      "content": "It is generally not recommended to take St. John's Wort while on hormonal birth control because it can interact with the medication. This interaction can significantly lower the effectiveness of your birth control, putting you at risk of unintended pregnancy. For your mood swings, I strongly suggest you speak with your prescribing doctor or a pharmacist before mixing any supplements with your current medication. They can provide personalized advice on safe and effective options for you.",
