    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i've been reading some blogs where people say it's fine as long as you don't take them at the exact same time of day. like, if i take my pill in the morning and the supplement at night, does that help? i really don't want to deal with the doctor just for a herbal supplement.",
